      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following customer reviews.\n\nIdentify:\n1. Top recurring themes\n2. Positive themes\n3. Negative themes\n4. Overall sentiment\n5. Pricing/subscription confusion\n6. Recommended product improvements\n\nOnly use facts and numbers that appear in the input. If a number is not in the input, do not write one. Say \"users report limits are too low\" instead of giving a figure.\n\nReviews:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data) }}",
